  "body": "In current implementations* editable links are not draggable:\r\n\r\nAn `<a href=\"www\" contenteditable=\"true\">editable link text</a>` cannot be dragged.\r\n\r\nThis defacto behavior needs to be mentioned in the HTML spec.\r\n\r\n\\* In Firefox 56.0, Chrome 61.0.3163.100, Safari 11.0 (12604.1.38.1.7) and Edge 15\r\n\r\nThis issue was found while discussing https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/705234/3/third_party/WebKit/Source/core/page/DragController.cpp#785 .",
